This folder contains the configuration and state files for the kilocode.kilo-code 
extension for the development environment. This folder is mounted at source=${env:HOME}/home/vscode/.local/share/kilo.

## Configuration

Configuration files for the Kilo extension in the development environment.

## Extension State

State files that store conversation history, preference settings, and persistent data for the Kilo extension in this project.

## How to Use

The Kilo extension (kilocode.kilo-code) is automatically installed and configured in the development environment via devcontainer.json. Files in this folder are managed automatically by the extension.